\newlabel{fig:isr4pi_background_spectrum}{{5}{12}{The $3\pi $ invariant mass spectrum from selected $e^{+}e^{-} \to \gamma _{\mathrm {ISR}}\pi ^{+}\pi ^{-}\pi ^{0}\pi ^{0}$ events (green points). The distribution is obtained after applying the dual-tag selection and serves as a clean template for background estimation.\relax }{figure.caption.10}{}}
